# M9 tutorial (docs/spec/tutorial.md): bopl-port --headless --drive
#   scripts/dev/m9-tutorial.drive --screenshot scratch/m9/tutorial.png
# Main menu -> Tutorial with the keyboard; the arrows (A, S, D, W), the bow
# pickup (jump); a controller takes over (gamepad hints), shoots the first
# dummy, picks the grenade, throws it at the second dummy, picks dash and
# dashes: back to the main menu.
60 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
20 shot 01-menu-tutorial
8 key Return
0 wait tutorial
100 shot 02-start
5 key A 60
70 shot 03-after-a
5 key S 60
70 shot 04-after-s
5 key D 90
100 shot 05-after-d
5 key W 90
100 shot 06-after-w
5 key A 8
20 key Space 12
50 shot 07-bow-pickup
120 shot 08-ground-down
# a controller takes over and shoots the dummy on the right
10 button pad0 a 2
60 shot 09-gamepad-hints
5 stick pad0 0.82 0.57 70
5 press pad0 a0 45
60 shot 10-bow-shot
60 shot 11-after-shot
# the grenade pickup (jump), then the left dummy comes down
5 stick pad0 -1 0 30
32 button pad0 a 12
50 shot 12-grenade-pickup
120 shot 13-left-ground
5 press pad0 a1 22
2 stick pad0 -0.62 0.78 60
40 shot 14-grenade-thrown
90 shot 15-after-grenade
# (the throw misses; an arrow hits the left dummy too: it is in its mask)
5 stick pad0 -0.62 0.78 70
5 press pad0 a0 45
100 shot 15b-left-dummy-hit
# the dash pickup, then dash
5 stick pad0 1 0 26
28 button pad0 a 12
50 shot 16-dash-pickup
20 press pad0 a2 6
10 shot 17-dash
0 wait menu
30 shot 18-menu-back
10 quit
